{"id":"668e712bdadc015a","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-theory-closure.md","title":"Theory Closure","display":"df-theory-closure — Theory Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-theory-closure","aliases":["92-df-theory-closure"],"display":"df-theory-closure — Theory Closure","depends_on":["[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-logical-consequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-theory-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-theory-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory-closure — Theory Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c75bb5270ee96d5a\" href=\"?note=c75bb5270ee96d5a\" title=\"92-df-logical-consequence\">92-df-logical-consequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence-set parameter, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_G\">\\(\\models_G\\)</span> (logical consequence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c75bb5270ee96d5a\" href=\"?note=c75bb5270ee96d5a\" title=\"92-df-logical-consequence\">92-df-logical-consequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_G\\)</span> (definition-target closure operator)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cn}_G(S)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid S\\models_G\\varphi\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cn}_G(S)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid S\\models_G\\varphi\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理论闭包：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}(S)\\)</span></li>\n<li>所有由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>语义后承的句子；在标准一阶完备性定理下，这与从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>可推导的句子集一致</li>\n<li>若“理论”定义为对语义后承闭合的句子集，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_G(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_G(S)\\)</span>是理论</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_G(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_G(S)\\)</span>的一个生成集，也可被选作相应证明系统的非逻辑公理；它不是由闭包定义自动产生的形式系统分量</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}(\\mathrm{Cn}(S)) = \\mathrm{Cn}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}(\\mathrm{Cn}(S)) = \\mathrm{Cn}(S)\\)</span></li>\n<li>闭包算子性质：单调、幂等、包含</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-logical-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"c75bb5270ee96d5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-logical-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","i